{"id": "sdqa0005", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Guitar Hero Live was first released in September of 201 5. It's the sixth main entry in the Guitar Hero series and marked a significant shift from previous games by introducing a new guitar controller that better simulates playing an actual guitar.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0013", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Battle of Sui Cho Fa Fort took place on April 2, 1 94 5.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0021", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first ruler of the Tang Dynasty was Li Yuan, who later took the name Taiz ong. He established the Tang Dynasty in 61 8 AD after overth rowing the Sui Dy nasty.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0029", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The current mayor of San Francisco is London Breed. She took office in 20 19 after succeeding Ed ward Lee, who passed away in office.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0037", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Pro hibition era in the United States happened from 1 9 20 to 19 3 3. During this time, it was illegal to make, sell, or transport alcohol. It' s like a long time ago when people couldn't buy regular drinks at stores because they were trying to stop drinking too much alcohol. But eventually, they changed the rules and allowed people to drink again.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0045", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Andy Richter left Late Night with Conan O'Brien in 201 0. He had been the show's side kick since its start in 1 993, but he decided to move on when Conan transition ed to a new network and wanted to try other projects.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0053", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "He grew up in the city of Melbourne, Australia.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0061", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The five stages of grief are denial, anger, bargaining, depression, and acceptance. These stages were first introduced by psychiatrist Elisabeth Kubler-Ross in her 196 9 book On Death and Dying. They describe the emotional process people often go through when coping with loss or trauma. Denial is the initial stage where someone might refuse to accept the reality of the situation. Then comes anger, which can manifest as frustration or resentment. Ba rgaining involves trying to negotiate a way out of the problem, often thinking about what could have been done differently. Depress ion follows as the person processes the full weight of their loss. Finally, acceptance means coming to terms with the reality of the situation and moving forward with life. It's important to note that these stages aren't always experienced in a linear order and may vary from person to person. Some individuals might skip certain stages altogether.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 47, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0069", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The World Wide Web was invented in 1989 by Tim Berners-Lo yce.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0077", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Speed is the rate at which an object covers distance, while velocity is speed with a direction. So for example, if you drive your car 60 miles per hour north, then that's both your speed and your velocity. But if you drive 6 0 miles per hour south, it would be the same speed but opposite velocity because of the different directions. Does that make sense?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0085", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A telenov ela is a long-running television drama series that originated in Latin America. It often features romantic plots, family conflict s, and dramatic twist s, with storylines that are usually fast- paced and emotional. So ap opera s are similar but generally focus more on ongoing stories about families, relationships, and personal drama, often with melodramatic elements. Both are designed to keep viewers engaged over time, but telenovelas tend to have a stronger emphasis on romance and quick resolution s to plot points, while soap operas may explore more complex character development and longer-running conflicts.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 38, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0093", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The latter entry refers to the last time someone entered the La teran, which is a church in Rome. That happened recently on October 28, 2 0 23.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
