{"id": "sdqa0109", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Emmanuel Pa ppas is known for his work in the field of astroph ysics, particularly his research on supernova e explosions and their role in creating elements in the universe. He's also recognized for his contributions to understanding how stars evolve and die.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0117", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The North American time zones were established in 18 83, when the United States officially adopted standard time and divided the country into four main time zone s: Eastern, Central, Mountain, and Pacific. This change was driven by the need for a coordinated system to support railro ad schedules and improve communication across long distance s.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
